(text "AOI211_J2N16: AND-OR-INVERT (AOI211), Y = ~((A & B) | C | D). 2 tubes, one cell per sheet.\n6Zh2B (A on g1, B on g3) and both triodes of one 6N16B (C, D on the grids) on one plate, Ra 15k to +150 V (2 W).\nScreen Rg2 15k from +150 V; Cb 15 pF on g3 holds B against the plate swing (g3 Miller, sch/logic/NAND2_J2/README.md).\nA-D: LV (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V). Y: HV (1 = +150 V, 0 = +50 V); one divider per output net, 3.9 pF per triode grid.\nInput divider C1 per grid: A (pentode g1) 2.7 pF, B (g3) 6.8 pF, C, D (triode) 3.9 pF. Unused C or D: tie to the other.\nSimulated, fanout 2/6/10: worst arc 217/328/450 ns to Y = 100 V; C, D rising alone 53-83 ns.\nHeater 6.3 V: 0.2 A + 0.4 A on H1/H2. Page: sch/logic/AOI211_J2N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "971c53ce-7f8e-4223-970e-e63b881a1dd0"))

